			"notes": "##  **Soundboard+** Update!\n\n###  New Features\n\n* Added the ability to **rename sounds**\n* Added the ability to **delete categories**\n* Added a new **Debug screen** for managing `yt-dlp` and `ffmpeg`\n* Added a new **sorting system** for organizing your sounds\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Fixed **#3:** Categories going off the screen\n* Fixed several issues with the **\"Stop All\"** button\n* Fixed several issues with the **Scroll Bar**\n\nThis update is for every version that has been supported, however 1.21.11 support might be discontinued on the next update.\n#### Enjoy the new update!\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1009\" alt=\"screenshot_main_menu\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9cd6107d-90a3-492b-bb9a-d56fd4ff15ae\" />"
