			"notes": "New **SoundboardPlus** update!\n\nChanges:\n\n* Introduced [JLayer](https://github.com/umjammer/jlayer) to all versions. With JLayer, it is now possible to play large MP3 files without long loading times or high RAM usage.\n* Fixed #2: MP3 files are now automatically resampled to 48 kHz if they use a different sample rate.\n* Added a \"Stop All\" button for sounds.\n* Support for Minecraft 26.2\n\nIf you have any questions, create an issue or message me on Discord."
		},
